        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">HostPapa is a family-owned Canadian web host that has been carbon-neutral since 2007. The VPS line pairs that green commitment with genuinely useful features: NVMe SSD storage, free domain + SSL + Cloudflare CDN, cPanel + Softaculous, and free website migration. The trade-off is a higher starting price ($19.99/mo) than budget hosts like RackNerd and a smaller datacenter footprint than hyperscalers.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $19.99/mo · 30-day money-back guarantee</p>
    </div>

