      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Family-owned Canadian company since 2006</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Carbon-neutral green data centers (since 2007)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Free domain + SSL + Cloudflare CDN on every plan</li>
